  ('zindi', 'Zindi', 'comp', 'African data science competition platform. Competitions are open to anyone; in some sponsored competitions the prizes go only to participants based in Africa.', 'https://zindi.africa', 'unknown', 'unknown', null, ' Savanna lists this as Kenya-relevant, but confirm the details on its own pages.', null),
