  ('masakhane', 'Masakhane', 'comm', 'Grassroots research community building natural language processing for African languages. Participation is mostly volunteer.', 'https://www.masakhane.io', 'unknown', 'no', null, null, 'This is a volunteer project and it does not pay contributors. Do not expect income from it.'),
